{"id":"5faf0467ca9c794e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md","title":"纽结消解的有限 Frobenius 复形","display":"df-knot-frobenius-complex — 纽结消解的有限 Frobenius 复形","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-knot-frobenius-complex","aliases":["58-df-knot-frobenius-complex"],"display":"df-knot-frobenius-complex — 纽结消解的有限 Frobenius 复形","depends_on":["[[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-knot-frobenius-complex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-knot-frobenius-complex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-knot-frobenius-complex — 纽结消解的有限 Frobenius 复形"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eb086d7ad41bcaef\" href=\"?note=eb086d7ad41bcaef\" title=\"58-df-knot-resolution-data.md\">58-df-knot-resolution-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,k,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,\\vartheta\\in V\">\\(D,k,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,\\vartheta\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,k)\">\\(\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,k)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vartheta\\in R\">\\(\\vartheta\\in R\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>完整图、消解圈、交叉顺序及立方体边使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eb086d7ad41bcaef\" href=\"?note=eb086d7ad41bcaef\" title=\"58-df-knot-resolution-data.md\">58-df-knot-resolution-data.md</a>；环的五元接口使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\to2\">\\(\\ell:\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\to2\\)</span> 为圈标记；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 标记对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 标记对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vartheta=0_R\">\\(\\vartheta=0_R\\)</span> 为 Khovanov 情形，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\mathbb Q,\\vartheta=1\">\\(R=\\mathbb Q,\\vartheta=1\\)</span> 为 Lee 情形。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^B\">\\(R^B\\)</span> 的加法、数乘逐点给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_B=\\{\\langle b,0_R\\rangle:b\\in B\\}\">\\(0_B=\\{\\langle b,0_R\\rangle:b\\in B\\}\\)</span>。所有下式中的和、积均有限。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_D,\\iota_D,q_D,\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta},\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,e},\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}\">\\(\\mathcal E_D,\\iota_D,q_D,\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta},\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,e},\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial\">\\(\\partial\\)</span> 在整个有限自由模上的图是下式唯一确定的图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf S_D\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf S_D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,e}\">\\(\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,e}\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(e,D)\">\\(\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(e,D)\\)</span> 时定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)\">\\(K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\">\\(u,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\)</span> 上定义；由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle\">\\(u=\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=\\langle t,\\ell\\prime\\rangle\">\\(w=\\langle t,\\ell\\prime\\rangle\\)</span> 取其唯一分量。所有关于该矩阵的断言均在此域上量化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal E_D(s):=\\{\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle:\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal E_D:=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathsf S_D}\\mathcal E_D(s),\\\\\n\\iota_D(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle):=|s|-n_-(D),\\qquad\nq_D(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle):=\\sum_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}(1-2\\ell(A))+|s|+n_+(D)-2n_-(D),\\\\\n\\mathcal E_D^i:=\\{u\\in\\mathcal E_D:\\iota_D(u)=i\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}:=\\{u\\in\\mathcal E_D:\\iota_D(u)=i\\land q_D(u)=j\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal E_D(s):=\\{\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle:\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal E_D:=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathsf S_D}\\mathcal E_D(s),\\\\\n\\iota_D(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle):=|s|-n_-(D),\\qquad\nq_D(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle):=\\sum_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}(1-2\\ell(A))+|s|+n_+(D)-2n_-(D),\\\\\n\\mathcal E_D^i:=\\{u\\in\\mathcal E_D:\\iota_D(u)=i\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}:=\\{u\\in\\mathcal E_D:\\iota_D(u)=i\\land q_D(u)=j\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM_\\vartheta(r,c)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n1_R,&amp;(r=0\\land c=0)\\lor(r=1\\land c=1),\\\\\n\\vartheta,&amp;r=2\\land c=0,\\\\\n0_R,&amp;(r=0\\land c=1)\\lor(r=1\\land c=0)\\lor(r=2\\land c=1),\n\\end{cases}\\quad(r\\in3,\\ c\\in2),\\\\\nD_\\vartheta(a,r)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n1_R,&amp;(a=0\\land r=1)\\lor(a=1\\land r=2),\\\\\n\\vartheta,&amp;a=1\\land r=0,\\\\\n0_R,&amp;(a=0\\land r\\in\\{0,2\\})\\lor(a=1\\land r=1),\n\\end{cases}\\quad(a\\in2,\\ r\\in3).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM_\\vartheta(r,c)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n1_R,&amp;(r=0\\land c=0)\\lor(r=1\\land c=1),\\\\\n\\vartheta,&amp;r=2\\land c=0,\\\\\n0_R,&amp;(r=0\\land c=1)\\lor(r=1\\land c=0)\\lor(r=2\\land c=1),\n\\end{cases}\\quad(r\\in3,\\ c\\in2),\\\\\nD_\\vartheta(a,r)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\n1_R,&amp;(a=0\\land r=1)\\lor(a=1\\land r=2),\\\\\n\\vartheta,&amp;a=1\\land r=0,\\\\\n0_R,&amp;(a=0\\land r\\in\\{0,2\\})\\lor(a=1\\land r=1),\n\\end{cases}\\quad(a\\in2,\\ r\\in3).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,e,\\ell,\\ell&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathsf S_D\\;\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{Cr}(D)\\;\\Bigl(\ne=\\langle s,p,t\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(e,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\land\\ell&#39;\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\setminus U_D(s,p)=\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)\\setminus U_D(t,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\setminus U_D(s,p)\\;(\\ell(A)=\\ell&#39;(A))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,e,\\ell,\\ell&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathsf S_D\\;\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{Cr}(D)\\;\\Bigl(\ne=\\langle s,p,t\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(e,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\land\\ell&#39;\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\setminus U_D(s,p)=\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)\\setminus U_D(t,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\setminus U_D(s,p)\\;(\\ell(A)=\\ell&#39;(A))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\n\\land\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\land\\ell&#39;\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell&#39;,\\ell):=\n\\begin{cases}\nM_\\vartheta\\!\\left(\\sum_{A\\in U_D(s,p)}\\ell(A),\\ell&#39;(\\bigcup U_D(t,p))\\right),\n&amp;\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell&#39;)\\land|U_D(s,p)|=2\\land|U_D(t,p)|=1,\\\\\nD_\\vartheta\\!\\left(\\ell(\\bigcup U_D(s,p)),\\sum_{A\\in U_D(t,p)}\\ell&#39;(A)\\right),\n&amp;\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell&#39;)\\land|U_D(s,p)|=1\\land|U_D(t,p)|=2,\\\\\n0_R,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell&#39;)\n\\lor(|U_D(s,p)|,|U_D(t,p)|)\\notin\\{(2,1),(1,2)\\}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\n\\land\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\land\\ell&#39;\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell&#39;,\\ell):=\n\\begin{cases}\nM_\\vartheta\\!\\left(\\sum_{A\\in U_D(s,p)}\\ell(A),\\ell&#39;(\\bigcup U_D(t,p))\\right),\n&amp;\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell&#39;)\\land|U_D(s,p)|=2\\land|U_D(t,p)|=1,\\\\\nD_\\vartheta\\!\\left(\\ell(\\bigcup U_D(s,p)),\\sum_{A\\in U_D(t,p)}\\ell&#39;(A)\\right),\n&amp;\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell&#39;)\\land|U_D(s,p)|=1\\land|U_D(t,p)|=2,\\\\\n0_R,&amp;\\neg\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell&#39;)\n\\lor(|U_D(s,p)|,|U_D(t,p)|)\\notin\\{(2,1),(1,2)\\}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle}:R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)}&amp;\\longrightarrow R^{\\mathcal E_D(t)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\\land v\\in R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)}\\land\\ell\\prime\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\bigl(\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle}(v)\\bigr)(\\langle t,\\ell&#39;\\rangle)\n&amp;:=\\sum_{\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}}\n\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell&#39;,\\ell)\\cdot v(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle),\\\\\nK_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle t,\\ell&#39;\\rangle,\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle)\n&amp;:=\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\operatorname{Cr}(D)\\\\\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)}}\n(-1_R)^{\\epsilon_D(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle)}\\cdot\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell&#39;,\\ell),\\\\\n\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}:R^{\\mathcal E_D}&amp;\\longrightarrow R^{\\mathcal E_D},\\\\\n\\bigl(\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}v\\bigr)(w)&amp;:=\n\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal E_D}K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)\\cdot v(u).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle}:R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)}&amp;\\longrightarrow R^{\\mathcal E_D(t)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\\land v\\in R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)}\\land\\ell\\prime\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\bigl(\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle}(v)\\bigr)(\\langle t,\\ell&#39;\\rangle)\n&amp;:=\\sum_{\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}}\n\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell&#39;,\\ell)\\cdot v(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle),\\\\\nK_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle t,\\ell&#39;\\rangle,\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle)\n&amp;:=\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\operatorname{Cr}(D)\\\\\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)}}\n(-1_R)^{\\epsilon_D(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle)}\\cdot\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell&#39;,\\ell),\\\\\n\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}:R^{\\mathcal E_D}&amp;\\longrightarrow R^{\\mathcal E_D},\\\\\n\\bigl(\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}v\\bigr)(w)&amp;:=\n\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal E_D}K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)\\cdot v(u).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall v\\in R^{\\mathcal E_D}\\;\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}(\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}(v))=0_{\\mathcal E_D},\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)\\ne0_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\iota_D(w)=\\iota_D(u)+1,\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,R,0_R}(w,u)\\ne0_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q_D(w)=q_D(u),\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,\\mathbb Q,1}(w,u)\\ne0\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q_D(w)\\in\\{q_D(u),q_D(u)+4\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall v\\in R^{\\mathcal E_D}\\;\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}(\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}(v))=0_{\\mathcal E_D},\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)\\ne0_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\iota_D(w)=\\iota_D(u)+1,\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,R,0_R}(w,u)\\ne0_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q_D(w)=q_D(u),\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,\\mathbb Q,1}(w,u)\\ne0\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q_D(w)\\in\\{q_D(u),q_D(u)+4\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land B,F\\in V\\land|B|,|F|\\in\\omega\n\\land A\\in R^{F\\times B}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}(A;F,B):=\n\\max\\Bigl\\{|I|:I\\subseteq B\\land\n\\forall c\\in R^I\\;\\bigl((\\forall f\\in F\\;\\sum_{b\\in I}c(b)\\cdot A(f,b)=0_R)\n\\to\\forall b\\in I\\;(c(b)=0_R)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land B,F\\in V\\land|B|,|F|\\in\\omega\n\\land A\\in R^{F\\times B}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}(A;F,B):=\n\\max\\Bigl\\{|I|:I\\subseteq B\\land\n\\forall c\\in R^I\\;\\bigl((\\forall f\\in F\\;\\sum_{b\\in I}c(b)\\cdot A(f,b)=0_R)\n\\to\\forall b\\in I\\;(c(b)=0_R)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>未受鞍点影响的圈通过相同半边集合识别，系数逐圈匹配；因此边映射包括所有恒等张量因子，而不是把整个边映射误写成裸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>两个参数值共享同一完整图、同一圈集合、同一归一化双分次和同一立方体符号。Lee 的额外两项恰将量子次数提高四。</li>\n<li>此处的有限矩阵秩由线性无关性直接定义，没有把维数表作为任意外加数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<p>M. Khovanov, <em>A categorification of the Jones polynomial</em>; J. Rasmussen, <em>Khovanov homology and the slice genus</em>, §§2–3. 以上为具体有限集合与矩阵实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-knot-resolution-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"eb086d7ad41bcaef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-knot-resolution-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"eb086d7ad41bcaef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"完整图、消解圈、交叉顺序及立方体边使用 [[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]；环的五元接口使用 [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"完整图、消解圈、交叉顺序及立方体边使用 [[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]；环的五元接口使用 [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Field}$ 取 [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,k,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,\\vartheta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DiagramOf}_S(D,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vartheta\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell:\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\to2","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\vartheta=0_R","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\mathbb Q,\\vartheta=1","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"R^B","display":false},{"tex":"0_B=\\{\\langle b,0_R\\rangle:b\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_D,\\iota_D,q_D,\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta},\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,e},\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathsf S_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,e}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(e,D)","display":false},{"tex":"K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)","display":false},{"tex":"u,w\\in\\mathcal E_D","display":false},{"tex":"u=\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"w=\\langle t,\\ell\\prime\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal E_D(s):=\\{\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle:\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal E_D:=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\mathsf S_D}\\mathcal E_D(s),\\\\\n\\iota_D(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle):=|s|-n_-(D),\\qquad\nq_D(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle):=\\sum_{A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}(1-2\\ell(A))+|s|+n_+(D)-2n_-(D),\\\\\n\\mathcal E_D^i:=\\{u\\in\\mathcal E_D:\\iota_D(u)=i\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}:=\\{u\\in\\mathcal E_D:\\iota_D(u)=i\\land q_D(u)=j\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nM_\\vartheta(r,c)&:=\\begin{cases}\n1_R,&(r=0\\land c=0)\\lor(r=1\\land c=1),\\\\\n\\vartheta,&r=2\\land c=0,\\\\\n0_R,&(r=0\\land c=1)\\lor(r=1\\land c=0)\\lor(r=2\\land c=1),\n\\end{cases}\\quad(r\\in3,\\ c\\in2),\\\\\nD_\\vartheta(a,r)&:=\\begin{cases}\n1_R,&(a=0\\land r=1)\\lor(a=1\\land r=2),\\\\\n\\vartheta,&a=1\\land r=0,\\\\\n0_R,&(a=0\\land r\\in\\{0,2\\})\\lor(a=1\\land r=1),\n\\end{cases}\\quad(a\\in2,\\ r\\in3).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,e,\\ell,\\ell')\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathsf S_D\\;\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{Cr}(D)\\;\\Bigl(\ne=\\langle s,p,t\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(e,D)\\\\\n&\\land\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\land\\ell'\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\setminus U_D(s,p)=\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)\\setminus U_D(t,p)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)\\setminus U_D(s,p)\\;(\\ell(A)=\\ell'(A))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\n\\land\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}\\land\\ell'\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\\\\n&\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell',\\ell):=\n\\begin{cases}\nM_\\vartheta\\!\\left(\\sum_{A\\in U_D(s,p)}\\ell(A),\\ell'(\\bigcup U_D(t,p))\\right),\n&\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell')\\land|U_D(s,p)|=2\\land|U_D(t,p)|=1,\\\\\nD_\\vartheta\\!\\left(\\ell(\\bigcup U_D(s,p)),\\sum_{A\\in U_D(t,p)}\\ell'(A)\\right),\n&\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell')\\land|U_D(s,p)|=1\\land|U_D(t,p)|=2,\\\\\n0_R,&\\neg\\operatorname{Untouched}_{58,S}(D,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell,\\ell')\n\\lor(|U_D(s,p)|,|U_D(t,p)|)\\notin\\{(2,1),(1,2)\\}.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle}:R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)}&\\longrightarrow R^{\\mathcal E_D(t)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)\\land v\\in R^{\\mathcal E_D(s)}\\land\\ell\\prime\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(t)}\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\bigl(\\mu^\\vartheta_{D,R,\\langle s,p,t\\rangle}(v)\\bigr)(\\langle t,\\ell'\\rangle)\n&:=\\sum_{\\ell\\in2^{\\operatorname{Cir}_D(s)}}\n\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell',\\ell)\\cdot v(\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle),\\\\\nK_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle t,\\ell'\\rangle,\\langle s,\\ell\\rangle)\n&:=\\sum_{\\substack{p\\in\\operatorname{Cr}(D)\\\\\\operatorname{CubeEdge}_{58,S}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,D)}}\n(-1_R)^{\\epsilon_D(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle)}\\cdot\\lambda_{D,R,\\vartheta}(\\langle s,p,t\\rangle,\\ell',\\ell),\\\\\n\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}:R^{\\mathcal E_D}&\\longrightarrow R^{\\mathcal E_D},\\\\\n\\bigl(\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}v\\bigr)(w)&:=\n\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal E_D}K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)\\cdot v(u).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall v\\in R^{\\mathcal E_D}\\;\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}(\\partial^\\vartheta_{D,R}(v))=0_{\\mathcal E_D},\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,R,\\vartheta}(w,u)\\ne0_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\iota_D(w)=\\iota_D(u)+1,\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,R,0_R}(w,u)\\ne0_R\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q_D(w)=q_D(u),\\\\\nu,w\\in\\mathcal E_D\\land K_{D,\\mathbb Q,1}(w,u)\\ne0\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ q_D(w)\\in\\{q_D(u),q_D(u)+4\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Field}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land B,F\\in V\\land|B|,|F|\\in\\omega\n\\land A\\in R^{F\\times B}\\\\\n&\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\operatorname{Rank}_{58,R}(A;F,B):=\n\\max\\Bigl\\{|I|:I\\subseteq B\\land\n\\forall c\\in R^I\\;\\bigl((\\forall f\\in F\\;\\sum_{b\\in I}c(b)\\cdot A(f,b)=0_R)\n\\to\\forall b\\in I\\;(c(b)=0_R)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false}],"bytes":6323,"backlinks":[{"id":"d0cea8c71c1f6767","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i,j\\in\\mathbb Z$。$\\operatorname{Cr}(D)$、$n_\\pm(D)$、$\\mathsf S_D$、$c_D$、$\\epsilon_D$ 使用 [[58-df-knot-resolution-data.md]]；有限标记基 $\\mathcal E_D^{i,j}$、矩阵 $K_{D,R,0_R}$ 与边映射使用 [[58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]。"},{"id":"5d2a105faa1b4258","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 $\\mathbb Q$ 的通常域运算。$\\mathcal E_D,q_D,\\partial^1_{D,\\mathbb Q}$ 使用 [[../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md]]。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-736","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-knot-frobenius-complex.md|58-df-knot-frobenius-complex]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["eb086d7ad41bcaef","1c30d21ea7b443f6","1eb4a89b005d9cda"]}